      "en": {
        "id": "story_cour_020_en",
        "title": "The Spark of Change",
        "content": "Courage drives progress in stagnant times. Across cultures, individuals like activists during the Civil Rights Movement took bold steps to challenge the status quo. Their bravery sparked transformation, proving that one act of courage can ignite widespread change. This universal initiative shows that courage is the force that breaks inertia, moving societies toward justice and renewal.",
        "readTime": 0
