        "content": "Courage provides stability amid chaos. Across cultures, stories of communities enduring natural disasters, like hurricanes, reflect this. People stand firm, helping neighbors despite raging storms. This universal resilience shows that courage anchors us, offering strength to face life’s tempests and support others, proving that bravery is a steadfast force in turbulent times.",
