      "en": {
        "id": "story_cour_023_en",
        "title": "The Bloom of Defiance",
        "content": "Courage thrives when doubt looms large. In many cultures, rebels like those in anti-colonial movements stood firm against uncertainty, their defiance sparking change. Their bravery transformed doubt into action, inspiring others to rise. This universal defiance shows that courage blooms brightest when it challenges hesitation, turning doubt into a catalyst for bold progress.",
        "readTime": 0
