        "title": "The Spark That Guides",
        "content": "Courage inspires others to follow. In many cultures, leaders like those in grassroots movements light the way with bold actions. Their bravery sparks hope, guiding communities through uncertainty. This universal leadership shows that courage is a beacon, illuminating paths for others and proving that one person’s bravery can inspire collective strength and progress.",
        "readTime": 0
