        "title": "The Bridge to Destiny",
        "content": "Courage transforms doubt into purpose. In many cultures, rites of passage, like vision quests in Indigenous traditions, embody this, where individuals face fears to discover their path. This resolve builds a bridge to their destiny, showing that courage enables us to cross from uncertainty to a future shaped by purpose and conviction.",
